        <mxCell id="c36" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:21px;font-weight:700;font-family:Helvetica;color:#5F4C00;&quot;&gt;The critical choice is “IP address on site → Site Local Inside”: it makes XC deliver through the CE&#x27;s SLI, not the public internet.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="177.4" y="949.0" width="1124.4" height="21" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
